---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Water Filters in Egypt | Community Transformation Trust" description="CT Trust funds household water filters in Egypt, bringing clean, safe drinking water directly into homes where contaminated water causes daily hardship.">
  <div class="report-banner-wrap">
    <img class="report-banner" src="/images/water.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
  </div>
  <article class="wrap report-article">
    <h1>Water Filters in Egypt</h1>
    <div class="detail-meta"><span>2025</span><span>Egypt</span></div>
    <p class="detail-lead">In many Egyptian communities the water that reaches homes is unsafe to drink. This project places household water filters directly where families live, turning contaminated water into clean, safe drinking water at the point of use.</p>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Clean water in the home</h3>
      <p>Contaminated water is a daily source of illness, lost school days, and lost income, and it falls hardest on children and families who can least afford it. Through this project, CT Trust funds household water filters that are placed directly into homes, removing the need for families to travel, boil, or buy expensive bottled water.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/water.png" alt="Household water filter providing clean water in Egypt" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Why it matters</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Immediate reduction in waterborne illness for families.</li>
        <li>Fewer missed school and work days caused by sickness.</li>
        <li>Long-term savings for households that no longer buy bottled water.</li>
        <li>A simple, maintainable technology that families can own and operate themselves.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>The lasting difference</h3>
      <p>Clean water transforms everything: health, education, livelihoods, and hope. By placing filters where they are needed most, this project delivers a sustainable, community-level solution that keeps working long after the filter is installed.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
